  SPLIT NOTE (build parallelism — no proof, statement or hypothesis moves).
  Carried over VERBATIM from `Checks/VmMapsDisjoint.lean` lines 2411-2425
  of commit 63c70ae.  Measured at 26 s — the second most expensive arm —
  which is why it is alone in its module: the point of the split is that
  this 26 s runs CONCURRENTLY with `prlimit64`'s 28 s rather than after it.
-/

